 "notes": [
  "goldmine-self corpus files are snapshot-pinned under evals/corpus_snapshot/ ('origin' holds the live path); the index and the labels consume the snapshot, so dev-day edits cannot rot them \u2014 refresh the manifest deliberately to move the snapshot",
  "foresight-rea is decompiled third-party code \u2014 local-only, its bytes are never copied into the repo (docs/v2/01 risk 9)",
  "fixture files marked 'requires' (say/ffmpeg) are existence-checked only",
  "fixture 'version' record (version + generator mtime + file count) is a corpus_sha input: a regenerated fixture invalidates loudly",
  "scripts/eval_relevance.py and docs/TEST_PLAN.md are excluded from the index \u2014 they quote the noise-query strings (self-leak, F6)"
 ]
}
